# Stable spec ID: iba-old-fashioned. Source checked 2026-10-12. Machine generated; not human reviewed.

::ingredients
(whiskey choice) = (bourbon) 45 ml -OR- (rye whiskey) 45 ml
(sugar, cube) 1
(bitters @ Angostura) few dashes
(water) few dashes

::equipment
(old-fashioned glass)

::instructions
(sugar) + (bitters) + (water) <muddle, in (old-fashioned glass)> ?= sugar dissolved
<add, ice and chosen whiskey> <stir, gently>
<garnish, with orange slice or zest and a cocktail cherry>

